<title>NEW ZEALAND: New Zealanders make more overseas trips in Jan - SNZ.</title>
<headline>New Zealanders make more overseas trips in Jan - SNZ.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand residents left for 63,150 short trips overseas in January, 11 percent more than in January 1996, Statistics New Zealand said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>In the year to January, visitor arrivals totalled 1,539,000, a rise of nine percent over the previous January year.</p>
<p>There was a net inflow of 3,740 permanent and long-term migrants in January, a drop of 23 percent on January 1996. For the January 1997 year the net gain was 23,680, down 21 percent on the January 1996 year. -- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
